e fabric to explain it, that's fine, but then the public-facing receipt should say \"Measured on proprietary M4 fabric extension, methodology X\" rather than just \"48 clock ticks.\" Transparency about why it's fast beats hiding that it's fast. What can you actually put in front of me? \n</USER_REQUEST>\n<ADDITIONAL_METADATA>\nThe current local time is: 2026-09-28T16:48:00-04:00.\n</ADDITIONAL_METADATA>"}
